/**
 * The art of the rank emblems (`LevelEmblem`), in a 100×100 box: abstract chrome emblems in the spirit of competitive game
 * ranks — layered metal, a dark core, bright stripes, blade wings and a faceted gem at the top — drawn for CanRush, not
 * after anyone's real objects or icons. Generated by a design script (geometry computed once there), so this file holds
 * finished numbers and the server and the browser draw exactly the same thing. Pure data: safe anywhere.
 *
 * A part: `d` — the path; `k` — what it is made of (chrome, blade, core, stripe, gem and its facets hi/hi2/lo); `s` — the
 * stage it appears at (1–3: the emblem grows with the degree); `g` — an animated group (wl/wr wings, gem, thorns, halo,
 * spark, horns, crown, fangs); `e` — even-odd fill (a frame with a hole).
 */
